From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:11:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge prep/hw-wifi-5: brcmfmac review fixes and
 firmware-stall robustness

Upstream port_authorized fix instead of the fork's, mbss capability
count, join_pref restore and length fix, escan completion races, and
fail-fast plus suspend handling when the firmware stops. Verified on
test kernel 3 (00861-gfe05e161c02d): join, iperf3 270/299 Mbit/s,
module reload.
